	(gr_text "in order to fit battery,\nmain cannot be centered.\nwhich means LHcontrols + RHcontrols cannot\njust be opposite side offsets,\nIF main+battery are to be on same plane.\n\n1,6mm offset is actually min as shown.\nthat is pretty convenient because it's almost\na PCB thickness, implying a castellated\nconnection\nresolves diffreences between RH and LH controls.\npin header is too high. so margin is narrow here."
		(at -171.496696 656.747035 0)
		(layer "F.CrtYd")
		(uuid "ad2e4f63-38e2-4239-8074-d02277b62cdd")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "with 25mm shaft, the vert pot if i go\nthrough a board, exposes 12mm of shaft.\n\nC2 exposes about 12mm, but the knob only\nrequires probably 8-9. so this {dblquote}should{dblquote} work.\n\nNOTE: this is a D-shaft, not knurled so i\nneed a different knob type."
		(at -301.130466 702.577034 0)
		(layer "F.CrtYd")
		(uuid "af2065cf-f3e7-4fc1-804d-c338203eab58")
